Package: vless-router-panel
Version: 1.0.0
Depends: curl, jq, ucode, uhttpd, kmod-nft-tproxy
License: MIT
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Xstrwe <https://github.com/Xstrwe>
Source: https://github.com/Xstrwe/vless-router-panel
Description: Web panel "VLESS на роутере" for OpenWrt (uhttpd :8088).
 Toggle transparent proxy, test connection and speed, save vless:// and
 hysteria2:// links. Requires a manually installed xray binary in /usr/bin
 and geoip/geosite in /usr/share/xray. hysteria in /usr/bin is optional.
